        },
        {
          "text": " Kitiŋata Nadab ka Abiku, odwe luka Aaron, ŋinituŋanan akeisupurunet, kibwaikis akim toma, kibwaikis da lukisupurununo, kijaikis akim naegela kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT, namam ŋes eeorakinit ke. ",
