            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mam ilomarete kiŋa kekek loka ewema loka airiamunun, kinyeis atwakare: naarai akinyet nakinyonyoanakina naka EJAKAIT ejai kamakus.” Kiswamata kesi kwape ejaar akirot naka Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
