        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Musa Aaron, ka Eleasar, ka Itamar, odweke luasalitos ebe, “Koyaŋaasi ainakinet naka akiria naedeun naka ainakineta nuka EJAKAIT nueinakinere kakim, konyamakis ariri naka etem komamei yenikitubuunet: naarai erai nakalaunan noi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyamakinete aibois nakalaunan, naarai erai ewaikon, ka ewai loka odwekon, kotoma ainakineta nuka EJAKAIT nueinakinere kakim; naarai kecorakinitai eoŋ kwaŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:14"
