        },
        {
          "text": " Komo Musa noi ekoroi loka ainakinet naka adiakaret, ido koany, kicwei: konyunyurik ŋesi Eleasar ka Itamar, odwe luka Aaron luasalitos, ebe, ",
          "type": "text",
